# General

- Prefer small, focused changes. Match existing patterns in the repo being edited.
- Do not refactor unrelated code or add dependencies without approval.
- Do not create documentation files unless explicitly requested.
- Only create git commits or push when explicitly asked.
- Ask when requirements are unclear.

# Scoped rules

Follow `laravel.mdc`, `vue.mdc`, `inertia.mdc`, and `tailwind.mdc` when globs match the files being edited.
